OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fthis evening, but cloud thickening
OL,7,Ffrom the southwest overnight, bringing
OL,8,Foutbreaks of light rain to the far
OL,9,Fsouth into the early hours.Though
OL,10,Ftemperatures will be higher than
OL,11,Fprevious nights, a touch of frost is
OL,12,Fstill likely.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FRather cloudy on Sunday with
OL,15,Foutbreaks of rain at first. This rain
OL,16,Fturning heavier and more persistent
OL,17,Fthrough midday before turning showery
OL,18,Fand blustery later. Feeling rather
OL,19,Fchilly and unpleasant.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
