OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCold
OL,6,Fand bright on Monday morning. Rain
OL,7,Farriving later, with hill snow
OL,8,Fovernight in the far north. Less
OL,9,Fchilly but showery on Tuesday and
OL,10,FWednesday. Colder air returning later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
